'''Lost World Yuki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She is the third palette swap of [[Mystery Girl Yuki (Uber Rare Cat)|Mystery Girl Yuki]]. Compared to other variants, Lost World Yuki has a faster attack rate and a better ability in exchange for worse stats. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] improves health and damage, is [[Immune to Knockback]] and can [[Barrier Breaker|break]] [[Barrier]]s. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

